  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed installation of an air source heat pump&nbsp;fails to provide evidence to demonstrate that it would not unreasonably impact the amenity of both adjacent neighbours due to insufficient information being provided. In view of the absence of this information, it&nbsp;could not be established that the proposal would accord with the requirements of Policy 57&nbsp;of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024).",
    "Notwithstanding the first point of refusal, the proposed location of the air source heat pump is considered unacceptable by virtue of its overall position, bulk and design, particularly in terms of its width; depth and height, would be an unduly dominant addition to the proposed roof of the single storey rear extension&nbsp;contrary to Policy 53&nbsp;of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024)."
  ],
